TruePix (Hyrax-derived)
=======================

This product includes software developed as part of the TruePix verifiable
video editing protocol.

Provenance
----------

The code in this directory is derived from the Hyrax interactive-proof
codebase (https://github.com/hyraxZK), with substantial modifications and
new code for the TruePix protocol.

